  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "勉強か何かだろ？\r\n灯織、そういうのちゃんとやるよなと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、他のみんながやらないって意味じゃないんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ……わかってますよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも……これ、勉強じゃなくて……\r\nそんなふうに言ってもらうようなことでもないんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ、そうなのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ずいぶん熱心だったけど、\r\n何してたか聞いても平気か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーなら……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──というか、目につく場所で書いていて\r\n聞くなと言うほうがおかしいですよね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020160"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00224",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あまり言いふらすようなことでもないので、\r\n他の人には秘密にしておいてください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、そんな感じのことか？\r\n俺が聞いちゃって平気か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0327"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーなので……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それが理由になってるか不安だけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、平気ですよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020190"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
