  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "会話メモ……と言えばいいんでしょうか\r\n人と話したこととかをメモしてるんです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今日だと、メッセで真乃がピーちゃんの話をしてくれたので\r\nどんな話だったかを軽く書く感じです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ……！\r\n何か理由とかあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ええと……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "恥ずかしい話なんですけど、\r\n会話のきっかけ探しというか……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "誰と何を話したか、ずっと覚えていることは難しいので\r\n元々会話をつなげるのも下手ですし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "下手とは思わないけど……\r\nでも、なるほどなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "誰に何を話したかとか忘れちゃうこともあるし、\r\nメモはいいかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ\r\nじゃあ、プロデューサー、これは覚えていますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "以前、好きなものを聞いたことがあるんですけど\r\nその時なんて答えたか",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020260"
  },
  {
    "select": "揚げ物だったか",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "煮物って言ったっけ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "……卵焼き？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020270,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "正解です",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あれ以来、揚げ物も割と作るんですよ\r\n『揚げ』と言うほど油は使わないですけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "後処理がなぁ……\r\n最近はそういう家電も出てるけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう頻繁に使うものでもないし\r\nひとり身だとなかなかやりづらいやつだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、ですね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201702/2002017020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017020300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なので、プロデューサーさえよければ\r\nまた作ります",
